<title>HONG KONG: HKFE launches CITIC, Swire stock futures.</title>
<headline>HKFE launches CITIC, Swire stock futures.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Futures Exchange (HKFE) said on Thursday it would launch stock futures contracts on CITIC Pacific Ltd and Swire Pacific Ltd A shares on Friday.</p>
<p>The new stock futures contracts would be the fourth and fifth launched by the exchange.</p>
<p>&quot;The addition of two more stocks will provide investors with a broader range of products to meet their investment needs,&quot; HKFE chief executive officer Ivers Riley said in a statement.</p>
<p>The HKFE launched stock futures on HSBC Holdings Plc and Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd in March 1995 and Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd in September 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
